<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - General Re target trimmed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - General Re target trimmed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers cut its target price on General Re Corp to $175 per share from $185, citing concern primarily over the company's international operations.</p>
<p>-- said expects disappointments from General Re's international operations in 1997-98 and continued sluggishness in the company's domestic business.</p>
<p>-- Kept neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-5/8 to 169.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212 859-1730))</p>
</text>
